ETIQUETA O CONSULTA:
Highlighting Target Properties Using Sequence Generators and Area Marks

DESCRIPCION:
Whether you are trying to optimize a single material property or combination of properties, sometimes a visualization can help compare the top result against viable alternatives. This series of plots compares polymer nanocomposite samples whose temperature-dependent thermal conductivity, as well as electrical conductivity, have been curated into MaterialsMine. The green regions represent samples with a combination of high electrical conductivity and low thermal conductivity. This chart also makes use of joinaggregate transforms to calculate means and quartile boundaries for the error bars. These example data were curated from Chandrasekaran et al. (2013, doi: 10.1016/j.eurpolymj.2013.10.008).

