ETIQUETA O CONSULTA:
Stress-Strain Plot with Dynamic Highlighting

DESCRIPCION:
Stress-strain data from tensile tests are plotted for samples from the published work of Gao et al. (2012, Polymers, DOI: 10.3390/polym4010187), which studied DGEBA epoxy resin nanocomposites with silicon dioxide nanoparticles as a filler. The reported tensile modulus values (units of GPa) are displayed upon highlighting a given sample's stress-strain curve. Since the tensile modulus is determined by the slope of the linear elastic region of a stress-strain plot, a line segment with a slope corresponding to the tensile modulus is also displayed.

