ETIQUETA O CONSULTA:
Interactive Dielectric Spectra

DESCRIPCION:
Dielectric permittivity as a function of frequency and filler loading. Click and drag in the bottom right chart to select a frequency range and filter the data in the scatter plots. These data in the NanoMine knowledge graph were curated from Fig. 6 of He et al. (2009, Adv. Mater., DOI: 10.1002/adma.200801758), which performed dielectric spectroscopy on samples of poly(vinylidene fluoride) with graphite nanoplates (GnP) as a filler.

